{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3155","id":3432786853,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz887MnCul","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3155","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3155.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3155.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3155","number":3155,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix: DestroyUser should only delete the target user's pre-auth keys","user":{"login":"newbdez33","id":114880,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDg4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114880?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/newbdez33","html_url":"https://github.com/newbdez33","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newbdez33/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newbdez33/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newbdez33/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newbdez33/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newbdez33/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newbdez33/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newbdez33/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newbdez33/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newbdez33/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- [x] have read the [CONTRIBUTING.md](./CONTRIBUTING.md) file\n- [x] raised a GitHub issue or discussed it on the projects chat beforehand\n- [x] added unit tests\n- [x] added integration tests\n- [ ] updated documentation if needed\n- [ ] updated CHANGELOG.md\n\nFixes #3154\n\n## Summary\n\n`DestroyUser` in `hscontrol/db/users.go` calls `ListPreAuthKeys(tx)` which returns **all** pre-auth keys in the database, then deletes every one of them. This means deleting any single user wipes all pre-auth keys for the entire system.\n\n## Change\n\n- **`hscontrol/db/users.go`**: Replace `ListPreAuthKeys(tx)` (all keys) with `tx.Where(\"user_id = ?\", uid).Find(&keys)` (only target user's keys)\n- **`hscontrol/db/users_test.go`**: Add `TestDestroyUserOnlyDeletesOwnPreAuthKeys` unit test\n- **`integration/control.go`**: Add `ListPreAuthKeys()` to `ControlServer` interface\n- **`integration/hsic/hsic.go`**: Implement `ListPreAuthKeys()` for `HeadscaleInContainer`\n- **`integration/auth_key_test.go`**: Add `TestDeleteUserPreservesOtherUsersPreAuthKeys` integration test\n\n## Testing\n\n- Unit test passes: `go test ./hscontrol/db/ -run TestDestroyUserOnlyDeletesOwnPreAuthKeys -v`\n- All existing `TestCreateAndDestroyUser` and `TestDestroyUserErrors` tests pass\n- Integration test passes: `TestDeleteUserPreservesOtherUsersPreAuthKeys` verified on Linux (Docker 28.4.0, Go 1.26.1, Nix)\n- Manually verified on a production headscale instance (v0.28.0 with this patch applied)","created_at":"2026-03-23T08:39:44Z","updated_at":"2026-04-09T07:30:22Z","closed_at":"2026-04-09T07:30:22Z","merged_at":"2026-04-09T07:30:22Z","merge_commit_sha":"7c756b82019755ee8110557ff57d94a0db66a0ac","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"